SUMMARY:The Neon Room at Helium: Nathan Macintosh
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 1510 SE 9th Ave\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:Energetic\, loud\, and always funny\, Nathan Macintosh is quic
 kly becoming one of the best comedians touring the country today.\n\nHis co
 medy has received numerous accolades. The NY Times named his special\, MON
 EY NEVER WAKES\, the "best Youtube Special of 2023" and his debut album\, I
  WASN'T TALKING was featured in Exc!aim Magazine's 'Top Ten Hilariously Goo
 d Comedy Moments' of the year. Variety named him one of their '10 COMICS TO
  WATCH' in 2024 and\n\nhis newest special\, DOWN WITH TECH\, has received a
 cclaim from Vulture and The NY Times and the clips from the special have be
 en watched by millions on TikTok and Instagram.\n\nNathan has performed on
  CONAN\, The Late Show w/ Stephen Colbert and he's a regular on The Ton
 ight Show. He also writes and stars in the Canadian series TRAPPED and he
  can be heard regularly on Sirius Satellite Radio and CBC Radio's THE DEBAT
 ERS.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from entering th
 e facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore in
